<title>HONG KONG: Cosmopolitan interim net up 10.7 percnet.</title>
<headline>Cosmopolitan interim net up 10.7 percnet.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.79     vs 10.65</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.75 gain vs 6.75 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    8.71	vs 7.87</p>
<p>    Turnover		     117.56    vs 33.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cosmopolitan International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Cosmopolitan International Holdings is engaged in real estate and securities investment.</p>
<p>The exceptional items represent gain on disposal of investment properties, net of disposal expenses of HK$4.09 million and write back of provision for diminution in value of quoted investments of HK$657,000.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
